# ============================================================
# OBJECTIVE 2: SPECTRAL CHARACTERIZATION OF CCD INFORMATION MATRICES
#   - Eigenvalue distribution (quantiles + spread measures)
#   - Growth of condition number and determinant with dimension k
#   - Link spectral measures to D-, A-, G-efficiencies (cube + sphere)
